{
  "title": "Ziyarate Imam Hasan Askari (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَوْلاَیَ یَا حَسَنَ ابْنَ عَلِیِّ الْهَادِیَ الْمُهْتَدِیَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya mawlaya ya hasana bna `aliyyi alhadiya almuhtadiya\nPeace be upon you, O my Master, O Hasan the son of `Ali, the guide and well-guided,\nوَرَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nwa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حُجَّۃً اللّٰهِ وَابْنَ حُجَّتِهٖ\nalssalamu `alayka ya hujjata allahi wabna hujjatihi\nPeace be upon you, O Argument of Allah and son of His Argument.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَفِیَّ اللّٰهِ وَابْنَ اَصْفِیَائِهٖ\nalssalamu `alayka ya safiyya allahi wabna asfiya'ihi\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s elite and son of Allah’s elite ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خَلِیْفَۃَ اللّٰهِ وَابْنَ خُلَفَائِهٖ وَاَبَا خَلِیْفَتِهٖ\nalssalamu `alayka ya khalifata allahi wabna khulafa'ihi wa aba khalifatihi\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s representative, son of Allah’s representatives, and father of His representative.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ خَاتِمَ النَّبِیِّیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna khatami alnnabiyyina\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ سَیِّدِ الْوَصِیِّیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna sayyidi alwasiyyina\nPeace be upon you, O son of the chief of the Prophets’ successors.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ اَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna amiri almu'minina\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Commander of the Faithful.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ سَیِّدَۃِ نِسَائِ الْعٰلَمِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna sayyidati nisa'i al`alamina\nPeace be upon you, O son of the doyenne of all women of the world.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ الْاَئِمَّۃِ الْهَادِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna al-a'immati alhadina\nPeace be upon you, O son of the guiding leaders.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ الْاَوْصِیَائِ الرَّاشِدِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna al-awsiya'i alrrashidina\nPeace be upon you, O son of the orthodox successors (of the Prophets).\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا عَصْمَۃَ الْمُتَّقِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya `ismata almuttaqina\nPeace be upon you, O shelter of the pious ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اِمَامَ الْفَائِزِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya imama alfa'izina\nPeace be upon you, O leader of the winning party.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا رُكْنَ الْمُؤمِنِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya rukna almu'minina\nPeace be upon you, O haven of the (true) believers.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا فَرَجَ الْمَلْهُوْفِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya faraja almalhufina\nPeace be upon you, O relief of the aggrieved ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا وَارِثَ الْاَنْبِیَائِ الْمُنْتَجِبِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya waritha al-anbiya'i almuntajabina\nPeace be upon you, O heir of the Prophets: the choice ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خَازِنَ عِلْمِ وَصِیِّ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya khazina `ilmi wasiyyi rasuli allahi\nPeace be upon you, O keeper of the knowledge of the successor of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا دَاعِیْ بِحُكْمِ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya da`i bihukmi allahi\nPeace be upon you, O he who invites to the judgment of Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا النَّاطِقُ بِكِتَابِ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha alnnatiqu bikitabi allahi\nPeace be upon you, O he who speaks with the Book of Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حُجَّۃَ الْحَجَجِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya hujjata alhujaji\nPeace be upon you, O prime Argument of all the arguments (of Allah).\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا هَادِیَ الْاُمَمِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya hadiya al-umami\nPeace be upon you, O guide of all nations.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا وَلِیَّ النِّعَمِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya waliyya alnni`ami\nPeace be upon you, O source of all bounties.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا عَیْبَۃَ الْعِلْمِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya `aybata al`ilmi\nPeace be upon you, O store of knowledge.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا سَفِیْنَۃَ الْحِلْمِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya safinata alhilmi\nPeace be upon you, O ark of forbearance.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَبَاالْاِمَامِ الْمُنْتَظَرِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya aba al-imami almuntazari\nPeace be upon you, O father of the Awaited Imam:\nالظَّاهِرَۃُ لِلْعَاقِلِ حُجَّتُهٗ\nalzzahirati lil`aqili hujjatuhu\nwhose claim is evident for the rational people,\nوَالثَّابِتَۃُ فِیْ الْیَقِیْنِ مَعْرِفَتُهٗ\nwalththabitati fi alyaqini ma`rifatuhu\nwhose recognition is fixed in the most certain things.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَیْهِ اَفْضَلِ مَا صَلَّیْتَ عَلیٰ اَحَدٍ\nallahumma salli `alayhi afdala ma sallayta `ala ahadin\nO Allah, send blessings upon him – the best of what You have sent upon anyone\nمِنْ اَصْفِیَائِكَ وَحُجَجِكَ وَاَوْلِیَائِكَ\nmin asfiya'ika wa hujajika wa awliya'ika\nof Your elite ones, Your arguments, and Your intimate friends,\nوَذُرِّیَّتِ رُسُلِكَ وَاَنْبِیَائِكَ\nwa dhurriyyati rusulika wa anbiya'ika\nand the progeny of Your messengers and Your prophets.\nاٰمِیْنَ یَا رَبَّ الْعٰلَمِیْنَ۔\namina ya rabba al`alamina\nAmen, O Lord of the worlds."
